# @@GARDEN@@ — what waits

What waits is a need on the bean it concerns (MODEL.md, the Contract of Parts): an agent that meets what it may not decide writes it there, `need … from:` whose it is and `note:` its class, its neighbourhood and recommendation in that bean's `details.waiting`, does everything safe around it, and carries on; the person whose it is meets it with their `say`. `python3 bin/waiting.py` reads what waits. This file is a view written from the needs, and below it the queue as it stood, history.

